#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:21
#: fe7a338c018d4036a9b3db097273c2c5
msgid ""
"**ARX Lift 2S** is the full-body ARX (方舟无限) mobile manipulator (including "
"chassis). **Acone** / **AC One** is **dual-arm**, not Lift 2S. **HighTorque "
"Panthera HT** (高擎) is a dual-arm manipulator. Prefer the dedicated how-to "
"pages. You don't need internal access for those `open-deploy-ws` branches."
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限 Lift 2S** 是全身移动操作臂（含底盘）。**Acone** / **AC One** 是 **双臂**，不是 Lift "
"2S。**高擎 Panthera HT** 是双臂操作臂。请优先看对应操作指南。使用这些 `open-deploy-ws` 分支不需要内部权限。"

