msgstr "**目标：** 先安装环境，再运行机器人演示（`hardware` 默认为 `mock_components`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:41
#: 8ccf9ab633f4481cbd7b2527aded2894
msgid ""
"[Install Environment](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — "
"Ubuntu 24.04, ROS 2 Jazzy + rosdep. On a bare host: add the ROS apt source, "
"then `ros-jazzy-desktop` / `ros-dev-tools` (fishros is optional). Workspace "
"entry is `./init_repo.sh`, then `source install/setup.bash`."
msgstr ""
"[环境安装](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — Ubuntu 24.04、ROS 2 "
"Jazzy + rosdep。裸机上：先加 ROS apt 源，再装 `ros-jazzy-desktop` / `ros-dev-"
"tools`（fishros 可选）。工作区入口是 `./init_repo.sh`，然后 `source install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:42
#: a93680b924604b80b93c758b6e9b236d
msgid "Clone `open-deploy-ws` and run the official init script:"
